# Project overview

Firefox MV2 (primary) + Chrome MV3 build of **OpenSource Partner Support** — opt-in affiliate support for RechnerLotsen. Related website: `C:\allmystuff\Rechnerlotsen\rechnerlotsen.com`.

## Architecture

- **Content script** (`src/content-script.ts`): click/landing intercept → opt-in overlay → messages background
- **Background** (`src/background.ts`): consent + partners cache; `webNavigation` redirects **only** when consent is `always`/`session`
- **Partners feed**: public JSON at `https://rechnerlotsen.com/data/affiliate-partners.json` (hosts/labels/param names only)
- **Support page** (website): `/support?dest=&partner=` applies affiliate IDs and redirects to shop
- **Options** (`src/options.html` / `options.ts`): consent reset / status

## Key paths

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `src/` | Shared TypeScript source |
| `src/manifest.shared.json` | Version, name, icons, content_scripts |
| `src/manifest.firefox.json` / `manifest.chrome.json` | Browser-specific manifest overlays |
| `dist-firefox/` / `dist-chrome/` | Build outputs |
| `artifacts/` | Packaged `.xpi` / Chrome `.zip` |
| Website `src/content/affiliate-partners.json` | **Only** place affiliate IDs live |

